1378 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UC Davis COSMOS\nSummer program\nLearned about machine learning and the details behind how it works from Dr\056 Moghimi and Dr\056 Pirsiavash\056\nUsed PyTorch and NumPy to implement linear layers and CNNs from scatch\056\nFinal project used vision transformers\054 a decoder \050pre\055trained on masked auto encoder\051\054 and a simple feature pyramid to improve the accuracy of SimpleClick\031s masks\056\nDemoed the research\055focused project to 200\053 attendees at the COSMOS Closing Ceremony\056\n\nAspiring Scholars Directed Research Program\nStudent researcher\054 Dennis Liu\031s Research Lab\nResearch project\072 comparative analysis of speech\055to\055text to find the fastest speed that an audio file can be transcribed while maintaining accuracy\056\nWrote code for the research project\054 mastered using ssh and scp for the remote server\054 presented research at ASDRP\031s Spring Expo\056\nLearned research skills \050e\056g\056 how to write and analyze research papers\051 and best software engineering practices \050e\056g\056 clean code\054 GitHub code reviews\054 using Docker\054 using ssh\051\056\n\nACE Coding Club\nCo\055President\nManaging all 3 branches\072 3 branch directors\054 340\053 students\054 and 84 high school volunteers over the course of 2 school semesters\056\nDirecting ACE Code Day\054 an annual event hosted at Amador that brings around 200 students and 24 volunteers to offer workshops on everything from robotics to server building\056\nBranch Director\054 Pleasanton Middle School\nManaged communications between teachers\054 students\054 and school administration\056\nOrganized 2\054 10\055week long sessions with weekly meetings after school\056\nOversaw every aspect of ACE Coding\031s operations at PMS \050e\056g\056 student and teacher signups\051\056\n\nTechnology Student Association\nCo\055President\nContinuing to organize chapter\055specific competition\054 Regionals Conference\054 and Nationals Conference\056\nAnswering any members\031 questions and keeping up club operations by hosting bi\055weekly meetings\056\nIncreasing club reach through workshops open to entire Amador community on relevant topics like agentic AI\056\nVice President of Administration\nOrganizes the club\031s operations and communications with club members and school administration\056\nResponsible for managing social media presence \050LinkedIn\054 Instagram\054 Discord\051\054 email\054 website\054 and more\056\nInstrumental to ensuring the 2026 TSA NorCal Regionals Conference ran smoothly by acting as a middle man between hosts and our chapter\031s participants \050paperwork\054 communication\054 questions\054 etc\056\051\056\n\nAmerican Regional Biology Competition\nWeb developer\nDeveloping ARBC\031s online competition platform for 160\053 concurrent users distributed nationwide\056 Working on core features like user authentication\054 anti\055cheat mechanisms\054 and the main test\055taking interface\056\nImplemented Realtime DB to provide real\055time\054 Google Docs\055style editing of questions for rounds that required team collaboration\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1379 0 R
     /Pg 1362 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
